      "snippet": {
        "line": 141,
        "text": "0 < c → iteratedDeriv m (polynomialEdge c p) = polynomialEdge c (jetPolynomial c p m), with polynomialEdge c p x = p.eval x⁻¹ * edge c x and jetPolynomial built from derivativePolynomial c p = C (2c) * X^3 * p - X^2 * p.derivative"
